---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout title="Personal Homepage" active="about">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/about.css" />
  </Fragment>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About <span>Me</span></h2>
    <div class="img">
      <img src="/gambar/pp.jpeg" alt="Foto profil Natalio" />
      <span class="garis-lingkaran"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h3>Data Enthusiast</h3>
      <>
        <p>
I am a data enthusiast and Bachelor of Informatics Engineering graduate from Sam Ratulangi University (2022 to 2026) with a GPA of 3.89 out of 4.00, currently seeking a Data Analyst role. I enjoy working across the full data cycle, from collecting and cleaning data to statistical analysis, machine learning, and dashboards that help teams make decisions. My tools include SQL and PostgreSQL, Python (Pandas, NumPy, Scikit learn, XGBoost, TensorFlow), Power BI (DAX), Excel (Pivot Table, Power Query, XLOOKUP), and SAP Analytics Cloud.
        </p>
        <p>
My experience with data began in the field. As a Voter Data Update Officer (Pantarlih) for the Indonesian General Elections Commission, I collected and verified data from 263 residents within 3 weeks at 95.4% accuracy. During my Data Engineering internship at PT Telkom Akses Manado, I cleaned 774 rows of procurement data from 2023 to 2025, normalized it into 7 relational tables, and validated more than 40 technical columns, reaching 100% data accuracy. I also built an Excel dashboard that tracks KPIs across 4 regions and a Power BI dashboard that analyzes the Amazon Prime Video content catalog.
        </p>
        <p>
Machine learning is where I apply that foundation to harder problems. I completed the Machine Learning path at Bangkit Academy by Google, Gojek, Tokopedia, and Traveloka with a score of 91.10 out of 100, and I hold certifications from Stanford University and DeepLearning.AI in machine learning and TensorFlow. At SATRIA DATA 2025, I served as Team Leader and ML Engineer, placing in the Top 20 out of 250+ teams in the national Big Data competition. At GEMASTIK 2025 (National Delegate in Data Mining), I built a pipeline for more than 8 million geospatial data points and used feature engineering to reach 97.9% model accuracy.
        </p>
        <p>
My latest project is RicaWatch, an early warning system for food loss in traditional markets, where I led a team of two and reached the Top 10 National Finalists at ASEAN Data Science Explorers 2026. It combines 1,055 chili and tomato price observations from two markets, interviews with 14 vendors, a daily oversupply risk score weighted with the CRITIC method, and a YOLOv8 freshness classifier, with an estimated 10 tons of produce per year saved at the pilot market.
      </p>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
